:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297603}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "09ca9278-0c20-567c-a5f8-c1e5fc82c7b2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297603} :answer-field/id #uuid "acafd20b-a624-534c-a948-7dfeb34188c8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299221}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "05df8d85-d4aa-50db-b657-3624538dbf63" :question/math-academy-id "q-316998" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}2z-2y-5x=5 \\\\ -3z+3y+4x=1 \\\\ 2z-2x+y=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $-5$ | {{field-1}} | $2$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $5$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $4$ | $3$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | {{field-3}} |  | . |\n|  |  | $-2$ | {{field-4}} | $2$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $2$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-5x-2y+2z=5 \\\\ 4x+3y-3z=1 \\\\ -2x+y+2z=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-5 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-5 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186426757 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059758 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations by Reorganizing"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8600538f-009c-502c-8f93-c0f999bc2b02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426734}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8600538f-009c-502c-8f93-c0f999bc2b02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426734} :answer-field/id #uuid "3858435e-6d82-5994-86f0-620119922670" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426746} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "11aba24b-9268-590e-8810-5c57e7e3c410" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426729}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "11aba24b-9268-590e-8810-5c57e7e3c410" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426729} :answer-field/id #uuid "3dca1250-a568-5b14-aa99-ede3c01994fe" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426747} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d3575d9f-b5c1-5e4f-8e61-3fb7541222f0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426738}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d3575d9f-b5c1-5e4f-8e61-3fb7541222f0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426738} :answer-field/id #uuid "58b5d536-1639-5442-8db5-05c5714eee02" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426749} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eefcde1b-d3b8-55ec-9bff-1b6b1e19f657" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426741}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "eefcde1b-d3b8-55ec-9bff-1b6b1e19f657" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426741} :answer-field/id #uuid "75499a87-c853-5d3b-8493-31cc1387404a" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426750}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "87b42522-bb27-5dd3-ac3e-bd3279e82fdf" :question/math-academy-id "q-317519" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}8y+6x-3z+4=0 \\\\ 5z-3y+x-6=0 \\\\ 7x-4z-y-9=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} | $8$ | $-3$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $-4$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $1$ | $-3$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | {{field-3}} |  | . |\n|  |  | {{field-4}} | $-1$ | $-4$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $9$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}6x+8y-3z=-4 \\\\ x-3y+5z=6 \\\\ 7x-y-4z=9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 8 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -1 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 8 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -1 & -4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299629 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059758 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations by Reorganizing"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ba42191e-a1b2-5cbe-be73-25f0fc307cc0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298362}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ba42191e-a1b2-5cbe-be73-25f0fc307cc0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298362} :answer-field/id #uuid "34e6ea13-72da-5a50-9831-59f3bb32ec83" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298820} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c62d600f-ef35-5c93-8a98-7c0b5d6bbb92" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298418}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c62d600f-ef35-5c93-8a98-7c0b5d6bbb92" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298418} :answer-field/id #uuid "525ad87c-5619-57d3-92a7-8525697b4703" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298915} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "861c6ed2-e966-5692-accb-b534f1e773b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298131}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "861c6ed2-e966-5692-accb-b534f1e773b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298131} :answer-field/id #uuid "88962de7-2fa7-50be-bcd3-a4e0c59688f8" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299095} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "146371ee-1c0b-5294-90fc-369dd2c1ae84" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297639}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "146371ee-1c0b-5294-90fc-369dd2c1ae84" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297639} :answer-field/id #uuid "b029a4eb-3160-581a-8813-6eaf9bdeebd7" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299234}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "cdeadc34-e7f3-5a9c-9bba-7c02bc1cee1c" :question/math-academy-id "q-317632" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}5x-3y+4=7 \\\\ -2x+6z-1=8 \\\\ 7y-5z+2=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $5$ | {{field-1}} | $0$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | {{field-2}} |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $-2$ | {{field-3}} | $6$ |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $9$ |  | . |\n|  |  | {{field-4}} | $7$ | $-5$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $-5$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}5x-3y+0z=3 \\\\ -2x+0y+6z=9 \\\\ 0x+7y-5z=-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -3 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}5 & -3 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186426756 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059758 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations by Reorganizing"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f600605e-c432-5a49-8937-87085525ad30" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426743}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f600605e-c432-5a49-8937-87085525ad30" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426743} :answer-field/id #uuid "28353e39-acc8-5471-9aa6-69d0698d44c5" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426745} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e1bb35e7-e173-5077-9b70-1eca4b1960a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426740}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e1bb35e7-e173-5077-9b70-1eca4b1960a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426740} :answer-field/id #uuid "858e4e65-7369-5bb6-9760-59c91beb24f5" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426752} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e1d1b7d-645c-539e-8352-b3dfb9ffcd03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426728}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0e1d1b7d-645c-539e-8352-b3dfb9ffcd03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426728} :answer-field/id #uuid "a0491ce2-8d7c-51ed-99a4-858a23cff123" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426753} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b7db70e-4c06-5847-ae4c-8d2d12c80e8b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426730}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1b7db70e-4c06-5847-ae4c-8d2d12c80e8b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426730} :answer-field/id #uuid "d7de047a-a7eb-5fa7-82bc-f250f9e7cda3" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426754}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "5bfaecd0-980e-55a7-befc-289a7a9c5c34" :question/math-academy-id "q-317636" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}2z+3x-5=4 \\\\ 6z-4y+3=15 \\\\ 7y+2x-2=11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $3$ | $0$ | {{field-1}} |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | {{field-2}} |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} | $-4$ | $6$ |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $12$ |  | . |\n|  |  | $2$ | {{field-4}} | $0$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | $13$ |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+0y+2z=9 \\\\ 0x-4y+6z=12 \\\\ 2x+7y+0z=13\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 7 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ 12 \\\\ 13\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 7 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ 12 \\\\ 13\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186426758 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059757 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1938c5da-d01a-53b7-a811-9afe1e43d152" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "223847b6-00fc-5235-8827-7e678d11053d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-3,\\,c=2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426731} {:answer/id #uuid "62f10e81-bf0b-5d8f-abd5-66b9009b22b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-3,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426733} {:answer/id #uuid "ca5cbda7-94a5-56d2-8e39-bf95cd46be03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=5,\\,b=0,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426736} {:answer/id #uuid "ccaa4421-7462-521e-bd86-4c7357d0d8ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=-1,\\,c=5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426737} {:answer/id #uuid "fc3f9e0f-2358-5b78-8d1f-f66161800384" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=-4,\\,c=5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426744}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ccaa4421-7462-521e-bd86-4c7357d0d8ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=-1,\\,c=5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426737} :answer-field/id #uuid "83a4688c-a103-5974-9014-77e44fbfd4ee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186426751}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "da13acd8-77ae-5f2b-ba9c-504353353d52" :question/math-academy-id "q-36179" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x+5z=5 \\\\ -x+5y-3z=2 \\\\ x-4y+7z=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & a & 5 \\\\ b & 5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}c \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x+0y+5z=5 \\\\ -x+5y-3z=2 \\\\ x-4y+7z=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=0,\\,b=-1,\\,c=5.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060276 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059757 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1938c5da-d01a-53b7-a811-9afe1e43d152" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "099fa1e0-d872-5eb5-81ed-b3b1edaada04" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-6,\\,c=11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321222} {:answer/id #uuid "138e861a-0cc2-58a9-9676-1ec3e92f91ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-6,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321303} {:answer/id #uuid "7024eba8-43e2-5236-ad74-99d0c32d9f47" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-4,\\,b=-4,\\,c=11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322019} {:answer/id #uuid "806f8895-3e66-5150-bdff-c12b2f1ea7b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=11,\\,c=-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322157} {:answer/id #uuid "ce2f6adf-c8fe-58ac-9550-1c74ef4b3ac8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=11,\\,b=-4,\\,c=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186322755}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "099fa1e0-d872-5eb5-81ed-b3b1edaada04" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=-6,\\,c=11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186321222} :answer-field/id #uuid "dbe13b71-8293-5712-8025-31df3dbc7ef9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186323607}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "5006a5f1-0a5e-50bb-a47b-7da41b1e709f" :question/math-academy-id "q-36181" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y+z=2 \\\\ x-6y+11z=3 \\\\ 3x-4y-z=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 & a \\\\ 1 & b & c \\\\ 3 & -4 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "We can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 11 \\\\ 3 & -4 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 11 \\\\ 3 & -4 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=1,\\,b=-6,\\,c=11.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345096 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059758 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7958ef60-8041-535b-bff8-b35e84c54412" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Entries of a Matrix Product Representing a 3x3 System of Equations by Reorganizing"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "899af756-e049-505b-aca8-fcddbcc599a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=1,\\,c=-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343433} {:answer/id #uuid "9934f80a-4330-52c3-b892-b8e6146150ba" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=-1,\\,b=2,\\,c=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343586} {:answer/id #uuid "a628bb7b-ab3e-5568-a237-263714a782db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=2,\\,c=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343701} {:answer/id #uuid "c77edf43-1b15-5283-9e68-19790d9e948c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=1,\\,b=2,\\,c=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343990} {:answer/id #uuid "d9de4d48-ae2a-5b5a-848b-ea2b298a17cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=1,\\,c=-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344150}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a628bb7b-ab3e-5568-a237-263714a782db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=2,\\,c=3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343701} :answer-field/id #uuid "063b5447-f723-563a-b519-b068df6762ef" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344505}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "c8162803-a4d6-5f94-9721-2c47db8e7ec4" :question/math-academy-id "q-75506" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}-y+z=1 \\\\ 2z+y+x=-1 \\\\ 3y-z+x=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}a & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & b \\\\ 1 & c & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}0x-y+z=1 \\\\ x+y+2z=-1 \\\\ x+3y-z=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=0,\\,b=2,\\,c=3.$"}]}
